# House Hlaalu: promotion. Crassius Curio's and Odral Helvi's work asks Kinsman (rank 4) and up; the rank rows
# (MorrowindRuntime FACT.txt: Speed, Agility; best favored skill, second; reputation) run to House Father 33, 33,
# 70, 25, 80. The quests so far gave the reputation; SetMercantile (Skyrim's Speech carries Mercantile and
# Speechcraft both, so it fills both favored-skill slots) and the attribute sets stand in
# for the player's training. Each "Advancement" asked of Nileno Dorvayn raises one rank, up to Lawman (3).
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance --instance 2 mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --load mwtest_a1_11_report --timeout 3600
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

case hh_advancement
run
player->SetSpeed 35
player->SetAgility 35
player->SetMercantile 90
approach 0549AC23
talk nileno dorvayn
ask Advancement
ask Advancement
ask Advancement
expect player->GetPCRank Hlaalu == 3
bye
end

# Past Lawman a Councilor must sponsor the player: Crassius Curio's greeting asks the player to undress (10), and
# greets an undressed player (PcClothingModifier <= 0) by raising them to Kinsman (100). UnequipAll stands in for
# the player taking off their clothes, and a common shirt for dressing again (an undressed player gets only
# "Cover yourself!" greetings, PcClothingModifier <= 0, which hide Dram Bero's topic).
case hh_crassius_sponsor
run
player->PositionCell 492 -116 -491 0 "Vivec, Curio Manor"
until 300 GetPCCell "Vivec, Curio Manor" == 1
approach 059264AE
talk crassius curio
expect GetJournalIndex HH_Crassius == 10
bye if open
console player.unequipall
wait 30
talk crassius curio
expect GetJournalIndex HH_Crassius == 100
expect player->GetPCRank Hlaalu == 4
bye if open
run
player->AddItem common_shirt_01 1
player->Equip common_shirt_01
end
